                                       "Welcome to SS2 Economics, Third Term. You will learn how nations plan their development, how organisations such as the IMF, the World Bank, ECOWAS, the AfDB, UNCTAD and OPEC work, why plans like the MDGs, NEEDS and Vision 2020 fell short, what challenges hold Nigeria back and how reforms such as bank consolidation and privatisation work.",
